                                "sense_id": "d7372143-608e-3f87-9ae1-99be61cffd43",
                                "text": "оку́тать ше́ю ша́рфом",
                                "translation": "to wrap a scarf round one's neck",
                                "english": "to wrap a scarf round one's neck"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "122bf96f-beb4-4b4b-a250-fb8b7daf20e6",
                                "sense_id": "d7372143-608e-3f87-9ae1-99be61cffd43",
                                "text": "Передо́нов оку́тал ше́ю ша́рфом и ду́мал, что в таку́ю пого́ду и простуди́ться не тру́дно.",
                                "translation": "Peredonov wrapped his scarf round his neck and thought that in such weather it was easy to catch cold.",
                                "english": "Peredonov wrapped his scarf round his neck and thought that in such weather it was easy to catch cold."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
